#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Yes, it works perfectly well for them. Although the main categories "
"currently available are Cycling, Running, and Triathlon, any sport where "
"groups meet to follow a route, use a GPS track, and track their progress by "
"distance and time can find the perfect club management tool in our app."
msgstr ""
"Ja, det fungerer perfekt for dem. Selvom hovedkategorierne i øjeblikket er "
"tilgængelige er cykling, løb og triatlon, kan enhver sport, hvor grupper "
"mødes for at følge en rute, bruge en GPS-bane og spore deres fremskridt "
"efter distance og tid, finde det perfekte klubstyringsværktøj i vores app."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Yes. A chat is created for every activity, allowing participants to discuss "
"topics related specifically to that activity. You can also chat privately "
"with members of your club."
msgstr ""
"Ja. Der oprettes en chat for hver aktivitet, så deltagerne kan diskutere "
"emner, der er relateret specifikt til den pågældende aktivitet. Du kan også "
"chatte privat med medlemmer af din klub."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. Administrators can accept or remove members."
msgstr "Ja. Administratorer kan acceptere eller fjerne medlemmer."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Yes. Ride with Pals charges a small 4% management fee on each transaction."
msgstr ""
"Ja. Ride with Pals opkræver et lille administrationsgebyr på 4 % for hver "
"transaktion."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Yes. The club's News section allows users to comment on each post, with all "
"the conversation kept together in a forum-style format."
msgstr ""
"Ja. Klubbens nyhedssektion giver brugerne mulighed for at kommentere hvert "
"indlæg, hvor hele samtalen holdes samlet i et forum-stil format."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. You can create public activities."
msgstr "Ja. Du kan oprette offentlige aktiviteter."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Yes. You can publish the same activity in as many clubs as you belong to. "
"You can also make it public so that people outside your clubs can join."
msgstr ""
"Ja. Du kan offentliggøre den samme aktivitet i lige så mange klubber, som du"
" tilhører. Du kan også gøre det offentligt, så folk uden for dine klubber "
"kan deltage."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Yes. You can schedule activities on a weekly, biweekly, or monthly basis."
msgstr ""
"Ja. Du kan planlægge aktiviteter på en ugentlig, anden uge eller månedlig "
"basis."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. You can upgrade at any time."
msgstr "Ja. Du kan til enhver tid opgradere."

